adiness gate for RAG-LITE semantic KG consumption. The gate reads only checked-in artifacts from HVY-01 through HVY-05: the semantic RAG input slice, EvidenceContextPack schema/fixtures, dry-run retrieval packets, answer-time posture validators, and Copilot/RAG pilot fixtures.\n\nThe generated audit queue artifact preserves explicit queue membership while avoiding large source-row clones. Queue items carry only stable item/queue identifiers, assertion or question identifiers, source pointers, status/audit posture, non-blocking flags, answer-fact eligibility flags, runtime-consumption flags, and fallback/readiness posture.\n\nCurrent readiness output reports 24 accepted assertions, 100 provisional-safe assertions, 124 safe RAG input assertions, 25 covered questions, 3,505 missing semantic coverage rows, and 7,038 total non-blocking audit queue items. All production mutation counters remain zero/false.\n\n## Verification\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/rag-lite-hvy-semantic-slice-validation.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/rag-lite-hvy-evidence-context-pack-schema.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/rag-lite-hvy-retrieval-packet-pilot.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/rag-lite-hvy-answer-posture-validators.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/rag-lite-hvy-copilot-rag-pilot-fixtures.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/rag-lite-hvy-readiness-gate.test.js`\n- `git diff --cached --check`\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T13:23:34Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T13:33:22Z","closed_at":"2026-07-06T13:33:22Z","merged_at":"2026-07-06T13:33:22Z","merge_commit_sha":"1a76dc80865d100c4519bea36456a72c6a28b21e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1396/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1396/commen